rationale	on this fixture the plane-wave and multimodal peaks differ by 3.22 cents at worst, with the multimodal ladder settled to 0.19 cents from N=4 to N=5. This does not say the multimodal image is wrong or unneeded. The scoping in this outcome was set on a 14.9 cent reading, which was a sign error; the measured value is now 3.22 cents, and the scoping has not been re-decided here. Plane-wave stays on the menu for the claims it still owns (D21: narrowed, never deleted)
